JOB SEARCH 102
Â We have done all the research for you.Â Â 
Are you out of 
work?Â  Thinking about making a job change?Â  Having a hard time finding a good 
job?Â  
Â 
Jobs are hard to 
find.Â  Learning how to find them is not.Â  The more you know about how to find a 
job, the easier the search.Â  
JOB SEARCH 102: WHAT THEY DID NOT TEACH YOU IN
101 is your link to a new job.Â  Â 
There is much more!Â 
Find out why you are having a hard time finding a job and 
learn how to get the job you have been looking for.Â  This e-book will give you a 
genuine edge in todayÃ¿FFFF92s competitive job market.Â  You will get tons of practical 
advice on topics such as dealing with job loss, resume writing, networking 
techniques, interviewing and negotiating.Â  After you read this book, you will be 
better prepared to launch a successful job search campaign.
Â 
If you were laid 
off, pushed out of your last job on an early retirement program, or are simply 
dissatisfied with your current job and want to make a change, you will benefit 
from JOB SEARCH 102.Â  This book will truly assist you in your employment quest.Â Â 
We have done years 
of research on how to find jobs and we are giving you the results of our 
efforts.Â  So why wait?Â  Do not waste any more valuable time.Â  Do not delay.Â  Get 
going on your job search, start working and making money now.
Â CLICK HEREÂ 
to learn more about JOB SEARCH 102: WHAT THEY DID NOT 
TEACH YOU IN 101.
Â 
if you do not wish to receive our job search mailings, 
please CLICK HERE to unsubscribe 
from our mailing list.

